#### [MODIFY] [LeftSidebar.razor](file:///opt/gtas_vpp/gtas_vpp_fe/gtas_vpp_fe/gtas_vpp_fe/Components/Layout/LeftSidebar.razor)
**Header:**
- Replace manual dark mode button → `RadzenAppearanceToggle`
  ```razor
  <!-- Từ Radzen MCP: -->
  <RadzenAppearanceToggle />
  ```
- Language toggle: EN ↔ VI working button
  ```razor
  <RadzenButton Text="@(glb.CurrentLanguage == "vi" ? "VI" : "EN")" 
                Click="@ToggleLanguage" ButtonStyle="ButtonStyle.Light"
                Style="border-radius:50%; width:36px; height:36px; padding:0; font-size:0.75rem; font-weight:700;" />
  ```
- AI toggle (Admin only, khi có quyền `MENU_AI`):
  ```razor
  <AuthorizeView Policy="@Permissions.MenuAI">
      <RadzenSwitch @bind-Value="glb.IsAIEnabled" Change="@OnAIToggleChange" 
                    Title="@(glb.IsAIEnabled ? "AI: ON" : "AI: OFF")" />
  </AuthorizeView>
  ```

**Sidebar menu:**
- Wrap AI Management menu item thêm `@if (glb.IsAIEnabled)`:
