### Phase 6: DataGrid & Shared Components 🔧 (Dùng Sonnet 4.5)

*Làm sớm vì cải thiện mọi page cùng lúc.*

---

#### [MODIFY] [app.css](file:///opt/gtas_vpp/gtas_vpp_fe/gtas_vpp_fe/gtas_vpp_fe/wwwroot/app.css) (continued)
```css
/* Enhanced DataGrid */
.rz-datatable-thead > tr > th {
    font-weight: 700 !important;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--rz-base-700);
}

.rz-datatable-tbody > tr {
    transition: background var(--vpp-transition-fast);
}

.rz-datatable-tbody > tr:hover {
    background: rgba(var(--rz-primary-rgb, 103, 58, 183), 0.04) !important;
}

/* Stat Card */
.vpp-stat-card {
    transition: transform var(--vpp-transition-fast), box-shadow var(--vpp-transition-fast);
    border-radius: var(--vpp-card-radius);
}
.vpp-stat-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: var(--vpp-card-shadow-hover);
}

.vpp-stat-icon {
    width: var(--vpp-stat-icon-size);
    height: var(--vpp-stat-icon-size);
    border-radius: var(--vpp-stat-icon-radius);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
}
```

#### [NEW] Components/Shared/SkeletonGrid.razor
Reusable skeleton loading cho DataGrid (dùng `RadzenSkeleton` từ MCP docs):
```razor
@* Skeleton loading state cho DataGrid *@
<RadzenTable Style="height: @Height">
    <RadzenTableHeader>
        <RadzenTableHeaderRow>
            @for (int i = 0; i < ColumnCount; i++)
            {
                <RadzenTableHeaderCell>
                    <RadzenSkeleton Style="width: 60%;" />
                </RadzenTableHeaderCell>
            }
        </RadzenTableHeaderRow>
    </RadzenTableHeader>
    <RadzenTableBody>
        @for (int row = 0; row < RowCount; row++)
        {
            <RadzenTableRow>
                @for (int col = 0; col < ColumnCount; col++)
                {
                    <RadzenTableCell>
                        <RadzenSkeleton Animation="SkeletonAnimation.Wave" 
                                        Style="width: @(Random.Shared.Next(40, 90))%;" />
                    </RadzenTableCell>
                }
            </RadzenTableRow>
        }
    </RadzenTableBody>
</RadzenTable>

@code {
    [Parameter] public int ColumnCount { get; set; } = 5;
    [Parameter] public int RowCount { get; set; } = 8;
    [Parameter] public string Height { get; set; } = "400px";
}
```

#### [NEW] Components/Shared/SkeletonStatCards.razor
Skeleton cho stat cards

