## Verification Plan

### After Each Phase
```bash
# Build
cd /opt/gtas_vpp
docker compose build --no-cache frontend

# Deploy
docker compose up -d frontend

# Verify container
docker ps | grep frontend
docker logs gtas-vpp-frontend --tail 20
```

### Checklist per Phase
- [ ] Build succeeds without errors
- [ ] Container starts and healthy
- [ ] Dark mode toggle works
- [ ] Language toggle works (Phase 1+)
- [ ] AI toggle works (Phase 1+): On → show AI, Off → hide AI cleanly without errors
- [ ] No console errors in browser DevTools
- [ ] All existing functionality still works (permissions, CRUD, etc.)

### Radzen MCP Usage
- Dùng `python3 radzen_query.py` khi cần examples cụ thể
- Free tier: 50 requests / 15 ngày
- Nếu hết, thông báo user để bổ sung API key

---

## Summary

```
Phase 0 (Foundation)    → Opus 4.6  → i18n + AI toggle + design tokens
Phase 1 (Layout)        → Opus 4.6  → Header, Sidebar, Breadcrumb
Phase 6 (DataGrid)      → Sonnet 4.5 → Global CSS + Skeleton components
Phase 3 (Dashboard)     → Sonnet 4.5 → Stat cards + Charts + Tabs
Phase 4 (Order Create)  → Opus 4.6  → AI integration + UX polish
Phase 2 (Login)         → Sonnet 4.5 → Redesign login page
Phase 5 (Secondary)     → Sonnet 4.5 → Library, Permission, AI, Report
```

> [!TIP]
> Sau mỗi phase, bạn dùng Gemini CLI check lại → confirm OK → chuyển phase tiếp.
> Nếu dùng Kiro (Sonnet 4.5), share plan này làm context để Kiro hiểu project structure.
